 mais aussi économiques. 

01:53:53.440 --> 01:53:56.640 line:63%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: 
 Merci beaucoup. 

01:53:56.680 --> 01:54:01.000 line:63%
 La parole est à monsieur 
 Emmanuel Fernandes. 

01:54:01.040 --> 01:54:02.040 line:63%
 - Emmanuel Fernandes: 
 Merci, madame 

